
  Error: `transition:` takes one of three tokens — `fade` / `slide` (layout-swap) or `none` (hover instant-snap). Per-call duration arguments (`transition: fade 200ms`) and other tokens are rejected; the surface is intentionally narrow per the v0.17 width-token discipline.

